@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Cancelling an order gives back its single-use coupon
+A single-use coupon SHALL be usable by one order only; when that order is cancelled, the coupon SHALL be usable again. A coupon that is not single-use is unaffected.
+
+#### Scenario: Cancel then reorder with the same code
+- **WHEN** order ORD-0001 placed on 2026-03-02 uses single-use coupon WELCOME, is cancelled on 2026-03-02, and a new order is placed on 2026-03-02 with WELCOME
+- **THEN** the new order is accepted and ORD-0002 is recorded as the coupon's user
+
+#### Scenario: Cancelled on day 14
+- **WHEN** ORD-0001 placed on 2026-03-02 with WELCOME is cancelled on 2026-03-16
+- **THEN** WELCOME can be used again
+
+#### Scenario: Not cancelled
+- **WHEN** ORD-0001 used WELCOME and is still confirmed
+- **THEN** a second order with WELCOME is refused as already used
+
+#### Scenario: Other order cancelled
+- **WHEN** ORD-0001 used WELCOME and a different order without a coupon is cancelled
+- **THEN** WELCOME stays used by ORD-0001
