+- [x] 2.2 Add a test for cancelling on day 14 (2026-03-02 placed, 2026-03-16 cancelled) giving the coupon back
+- [x] 2.3 Run `npm test` and confirm all tests pass
+
+## 3. README
+
+- [x] 3.1 No README rule changes (the code is brought in line with the existing rules); confirm no edit is needed
